<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 605.38, up 2.26.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.07.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 288 to 226.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 24,651,215 compared with 19,270,590 on Thursday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1881))</p>
